    "front": "SCENARIO: Multi-agent pipeline crashes after completing 12 of 18 documents. How to resume without losing fidelity or repeating completed work?",
    "back": "✅ Extract completed work to a STRUCTURED JSON CHECKPOINT file.\nStart a FRESH session.\nInject checkpoint at top of the prompt:\n• complete: [list of finished docs]\n• partial: [partially processed with sections complete]\n• pending: [not yet started]\n\n❌ --resume directly on crashed session (stale tool results → unreliable reasoning)\n❌ fork_session (for divergent exploration, NOT crash recovery)\n❌ Resume without marking partial states (agent re-does or skips work)\n\n💡 Stale tool results from a crashed session are untrustworthy.\n💡 Checkpoint → fresh session → inject → resume from verified good state.",
